{"info": {"address1": "102, Mangalam Corporate House", "address2": "42, Shrimali Society Netaji Marg, Mithakhali Navrangpura", "city": "Ahmedabad", "zip": "380009", "country": "India", "phone": "91 79 6161 5000", "website": "https://www.mangalamworldwide.com", "industry": "Steel", "industryKey": "steel", "industryDisp": "Steel", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "Mangalam Worldwide Limited manufactures and sells stainless steel billets and ingots in India. The company offers stainless steel billets, flat bars, and round bars. It also provides bright bars, seamless tubes, pipes, and ERW pipes. In addition, the company is involved in the dealing and trading of steel and other merchandise, as well as offers consultancy services. Further, it provides continuous cast billets; square bars; hexagonal bars; forged quality ingots; RCS bars; hot rolled round bars; heat exchanger and U tubes; hydraulic and instrumentation tubes; and hot finish mother hollows. Its products are used in the oil and gas, refinery and petrochemicals, transportation, dairy processing equipment, power generation, heat exchangers, pharmaceuticals and medical equipment, aerospace, and defense sectors. The company offers its products under the Mangalam Saarloh and Manglam Tubicore brands. The company was founded in 1942 and is headquartered in Ahmedabad, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 370, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vipin Prakash O. Mangal", "age": 58, "title": "Executive Chairman", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Chanakya Prakash V. Mangal", "age": 30, "title": "MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1995, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 6000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Chandragupt Prakash V. Mangal", "age": 28, "title": "MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn":